No. 2 surface, Quality q3 - glazing select,<MET> [_____] mm</MET><ENG> [_____] inch</ENG>thick, conforming to <RID>ASTM C1048</RID>.  Glass performance must be<MET> K-Value/Winter Nighttime 
[_____],</MET><ENG> R-Value/Winter Nighttime [_____],</ENG> shading coefficient [_____].  Color must be [_____].</TXT><BRK/>
